%% Planned before implementation, 2026-11-05. Design flow, not a runtime trace.
flowchart TD
    Player[Player opens Production / factory plan] --> Panel[Scene-owned factory plan panel]
    Session[Current GameSession] -->|state_changed / simulation_changed| Dirty[Mark presentation dirty]
    Panel -->|visibility changed to visible| Dirty
    Dirty --> Gate{Visible and no refresh pending?}
    Gate -->|yes| Deferred[One deferred refresh]
    Gate -->|hidden| Retain[Retain dirty state until shown]
    Deferred --> Guard{Still bound, visible and inside scene tree?}
    Guard -->|yes| Query[Pure narrow FactoryPlan.view of current model]
    Guard -->|no| Stop[Discard obsolete callback]
    Query --> Facts[Actual workers, construction instances, selected activity inputs and completed batch history]
    Facts --> Steps[Workers / Materials Plant / Munitions / real material output / real ammunition output]
    Steps --> UI[Truthful step states and next useful action]
    UI -->|player chooses contextual action| Nav[Existing rear navigation and selection]
    Nav --> Controls[Existing Build / Workers / Supplies / Production controls]
    Controls --> Commands[Existing authoritative purchase, placement, staffing and production commands]
    Commands --> Owners[Receiving / Construction / Rear / Production owners]
    Owners -->|committed state event| Session
    Session -->|replacement| Rebind[Clear stale view and read current model]
    Panel -->|exit or bind different session| Disconnect[Disconnect old subscriptions]
    Retain -->|shown| Dirty
    Rebind --> Dirty
    classDef authoritative fill:#d5e7d4,stroke:#456b43
    class Session,Owners,Facts authoritative
